    "text": "Let<math><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is the constant of integration) and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> is",
